    },
    "The recipients lose access right away. Hosts and credentials they have already imported stay on their Macs — revoking cannot take those back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接收者将立即失去访问权限。他们已导入的主机和凭据仍保留在他们的 Mac 上——撤销无法收回这些内容。"
          }
