        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此哈希条目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This host connects via a jump host that no longer exists (or is itself behind a jump host — one hop only). Edit the host and pick another, or None." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此主机通过一台已不存在的跳板机连接（或该跳板机本身也在跳板机之后——仅支持一跳）。请编辑主机并选择另一台，或选择“无”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This log does not match its session." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此日志与其会话不一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac: %@ · %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本机：%1$@ · %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac: no IPv4" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本机：无 IPv4"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This replaces every group, host and setting in SheepTerm. Your current hosts, credentials list and settings are copied aside first, so nothing is lost for good. Passwords are not part of a backup — they stay in the Keychain of the Mac they were saved on, so a credential restored from another Mac will ask for its password on every connection until you re-enter it in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这将替换 SheepTerm 中的所有分组、主机和设置。当前的主机、凭据列表和设置会先另存一份，因此不会永久丢失。密码不包含在备份中——它们保留在保存它们的 Mac 的钥匙串中，因此从另一台 Mac 恢复的凭据在每次连接时都会要求输入密码，直到您在设置中重新输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "this session" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This session connects to the same target with different settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此会话以不同的设置连接到同一目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time allowed for the device CLI to process each command" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "留给设备 CLI 处理每条命令的时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trust Both Keys" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "信任两个密钥"
          }
        }
