    "“%@” says" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” was removed from SheepTerm, but macOS refused to delete its stored password. It is still in your login keychain under “Bestchaan.SheepTerm” and SheepTerm can no longer reach it — remove it in Keychain Access if you want it gone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”已从 SheepTerm 中移除，但 macOS 拒绝删除其存储的密码。该密码仍以“Bestchaan.SheepTerm”保存在您的登录钥匙串中，SheepTerm 已无法访问——如需删除，请在“钥匙串访问”中移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” was saved, but macOS refused to store its password. SheepTerm will ask for it on every connection until the credential is added again with the Keychain unlocked." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”已保存，但 macOS 拒绝存储其密码。在钥匙串解锁的情况下重新添加该凭据之前，SheepTerm 每次连接都会要求输入密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "↩ connect first result · esc close" : {
