            "value" : "外观"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applied to every open tab immediately; the grid re-measures, so columns and rows change with it. Also in View → Terminal Font, with ⌘+ / ⌘− for the size. On a display running a scaled resolution (the 13″ Air's stock 1470 × 956 is one) the whole screen is resampled before it reaches the eye, and a larger or heavier face survives that better than a thin one; Termius draws roughly 14 pt Semibold. Font smoothing is macOS's stroke thickening: on it makes light-on-dark text bolder with a soft grey edge, off (the default) draws thinner, cleaner stems — the same edge the Claude app's text has." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Applied to every open tab immediately; the grid re-measures, so columns and rows change with it. Also in View → Terminal Font, with ⌘+ / ⌘− for the size. On a display running a scaled resolution (the 13″ Air's stock 1470 × 956 is one) the whole screen is resampled before it reaches the eye, and a larger or heavier face survives that better than a thin one; Termius draws roughly 14 pt Semibold. Font smoothing is macOS's stroke thickening: on it makes light-on-dark text bolder with a soft grey edge, off (the default) draws thinner, cleaner stems — the same edge the Claude app's text has."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "立即应用到所有已打开的标签页；网格会重新测量，因此列数和行数也会随之变化。也可在“显示” → “终端字体”中调整，用 ⌘+ / ⌘− 改变大小。在运行缩放分辨率的显示器上（13 英寸 Air 的默认 1470 × 956 就是一例），整个画面在到达眼睛之前会被重新采样，因此较大或较粗的字形比细字更能保持清晰；Termius 大约使用 14 磅半粗体。字体平滑是 macOS 的笔画增粗：开启后会让深色背景上的浅色文字更粗，并带有柔和的灰色边缘；关闭（默认）则会绘制得更细、更干净——与 Claude 应用文字的边缘效果相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
