    "Host keys you trusted, from %@. Remove one only when you know the device's key really changed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您信任的主机密钥，来自 %@。只有在您确认设备密钥确实已更改时，才移除其中一个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hosts added here never write a session log, even with Log Sessions to File on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hosts added here never write a session log, even with Log Sessions to File on."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在此添加的主机永远不会写入会话日志，即使已开启“将会话日志保存到文件”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hosts, groups, snippets, settings and passwords on every Mac — encrypted with your passphrase before they leave this one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hosts, groups, snippets, settings and passwords on every Mac — encrypted with your passphrase before they leave this one."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每台 Mac 上的主机、分组、代码片段、设置和密码——在离开这台 Mac 之前使用您的密码短语加密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hosts, groups, snippets, settings and saved passwords follow you to every Mac signed in to the same Google account. Everything is encrypted on this Mac with your sync passphrase before it is uploaded to a hidden SheepTerm folder in your own Google Drive." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hosts, groups, snippets, settings and saved passwords follow you to every Mac signed in to the same Google account. Everything is encrypted on this Mac with your sync passphrase before it is uploaded to a hidden SheepTerm folder in your own Google Drive."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主机、分组、代码片段、设置和已保存的密码会跟随您到登录同一 Google 账户的每台 Mac。所有内容都会先在这台 Mac 上使用您的同步密码短语加密，然后上传到您自己的 Google 云端硬盘中的隐藏 SheepTerm 文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the sidebar and tab bar are painted. Liquid Glass picks up the desktop behind the window (macOS 26); Solid Color keeps the flat chrome tile. The layout is the same either way — the terminal itself is never translucent." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How the sidebar and tab bar are painted. Liquid Glass picks up the desktop behind the window (macOS 26); Solid Color keeps the flat chrome tile. The layout is the same either way — the terminal itself is never translucent."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "边栏和标签页栏的绘制方式。“液态玻璃”会透出窗口后面的桌面（macOS 26）；“纯色”则保留平整的界面色块。两种方式的布局相同——终端本身永远不会半透明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "http:// or https:// — https:// is added when there is no scheme" : {
      "localizations" : {
