    "Lets this host use your local ssh-agent keys to hop onward. Only enable it for hosts you trust — root there can use the socket while you are connected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lets this host use your local ssh-agent keys to hop onward. Only enable it for hosts you trust — root there can use the socket while you are connected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许此主机使用您本地的 ssh-agent 密钥继续跳转。仅对您信任的主机启用——连接期间，那里的 root 用户可以使用该套接字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets vim or tmux on a device copy into the Mac's clipboard. Off by default: a compromised device could plant a command for your next ⌘V. When on, pasting text a session set always asks first. Reading the clipboard is never allowed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lets vim or tmux on a device copy into the Mac's clipboard. Off by default: a compromised device could plant a command for your next ⌘V. When on, pasting text a session set always asks first. Reading the clipboard is never allowed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许设备上的 vim 或 tmux 复制到 Mac 的剪贴板。默认关闭：被攻破的设备可能会为您的下一次 ⌘V 埋下命令。开启后，粘贴由会话设置的文本时始终会先询问。永远不允许读取剪贴板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
