    "One file with every group and host, the Recent list, credential names and all app settings. Passwords are never included — they stay in this Mac's Keychain. Restoring replaces the current configuration and copies it aside first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One file with every group and host, the Recent list, credential names and all app settings. Passwords are never included — they stay in this Mac's Keychain. Restoring replaces the current configuration and copies it aside first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个文件包含所有分组和主机、“最近连接”列表、凭据名称以及所有应用设置。密码永远不会包含在内——它们保留在此 Mac 的钥匙串中。恢复会替换当前配置，并先将其备份到一旁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
