    "When a session that had been working drops, reconnect automatically (3 tries: 2 s / 5 s / 10 s). Serial counts: a console cable on a rebooting switch drops exactly the way an SSH session does. SSH sessions also send a keepalive every 60 s to survive device idle-timeouts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When a session that had been working drops, reconnect automatically (3 tries: 2 s / 5 s / 10 s). Serial counts: a console cable on a rebooting switch drops exactly the way an SSH session does. SSH sessions also send a keepalive every 60 s to survive device idle-timeouts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当原本正常工作的会话断开时，自动重新连接（尝试 3 次：2 秒 / 5 秒 / 10 秒）。串口也适用：重启中的交换机上的控制台线断开方式与 SSH 会话完全相同。SSH 会话还会每 60 秒发送一次 keepalive，以承受设备空闲超时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
